@startuml
title Sequence Diagram 06 - Asynchronous Notification Flow

actor "Customer" as Customer
participant "Ticket Service" as Ticket
queue "Message Broker\nRabbitMQ / Kafka" as Broker
participant "Notification Service" as Notification
participant "SMS Provider" as SmsProvider
participant "Email Provider" as EmailProvider
database "PostgreSQL" as DB

Ticket -> Broker: Publish TicketIssued event
Broker -> Notification: Deliver TicketIssued event

Notification -> DB: Save notification with PENDING status
DB --> Notification: Notification saved

Notification -> SmsProvider: Send SMS confirmation
SmsProvider --> Notification: SMS delivery result

Notification -> EmailProvider: Send email with ticket
EmailProvider --> Notification: Email delivery result

alt SMS and Email sent successfully
    Notification -> DB: Update notification status to SENT
    DB --> Notification: Status updated
    Notification --> Customer: Receive SMS / Email confirmation
else Notification failed
    Notification -> DB: Update notification status to FAILED
    DB --> Notification: Status updated
    Notification -> Broker: Publish NotificationRetryRequested event
end

@enduml
